    "raw_reply": "Estelle Brachlianoff is the current global Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of Veolia.  \nVeolia does not have a single modern founder; it was originally established by Imperial Decree in 1853 as Compagnie G\u00e9n\u00e9rale des Eaux (CGE) by Emperor Napoleon III.  \nGlenn Vicevic serves as the Chief Technology Officer (CTO) for Veolia Water Technologies.  \nChrist\u00e8le Drolon is the Executive Vice President of Marketing, Sales, and Commercial Excellence for Water Technologies (Head of Marketing).  \nStuart Stock is the Vice President of Digital Business & Technology (Head of AI/Digital Business).  \nPreet Brar is CEO & Country Director for India and Bangladesh; Gavin Graveson is CEO for the Asia-Pacific Zone; Nad\u00e8ge Petit is CEO for the North America Zone; Thierry Dezenclos is Country Director for the UAE; Laurent Gestin is Country Director for Qatar.  \nVerified direct emails for these executives are not publicly listed; contact is typically initiated through corporate channels or verified profiles.",
